title:: CaosBoxGUI
summary:: View registry: palette, step grids, routes and analyzers.
categories:: CaosBox
related:: Classes/CaosStepGrid, Classes/CaosBox

description::
The registry the API uses to talk to the view. It is reached through
code::CaosBox.gui::. It stores the global accent, the step grids, the route popups,
the mute, solo and random buttons, the themed sliders and labels, and the
analyzer window.

instancemethods::

method:: color
Accepts a link::Classes/Color::, a symbol (code::\red::, code::\orange::, ...) or an
RGB(A) array. Repaints grids, buttons, sliders, labels and popups.
code::
CaosBox.gui.color(\orange);
CaosBox.gui.color(Color.blue);
::

method:: freqAnalyzer
method:: toggleFreqAnalyzer
Opens or closes the floating FFT and oscilloscope window.

method:: addStepGrid
method:: playhead
method:: addRoute
method:: routeChanged
method:: addMuteView
method:: addSoloView
method:: trackStateChanged
method:: addRandomView
method:: trackPatternChanged
Internal view registry; these are normally not called from live coding. The
mute and solo buttons are refreshed from the model after code::CaosBox.mute:: and
code::CaosBox.solo::. The random button follows
code::CaosBox.hasPatternHistory:: so it also reacts when the API changes the
pattern.

method:: scaleLowerSection
Internal layout helper. Reparte el bloque inferior (master, efectos, filtros,
granulador y transporte) en el ancho de 1180 conservando la proporción del diseño
de 1120. Es idempotente.

method:: themeLegacy
Walks the window once and applies the palette to the legacy widgets.
